  "summary": "Hi there,\n\n\n\nI am a full-time software developer with 2+ years of professional development experience.\n\n\n\nI always enjoy working in a collaborative environment with other software developers and tech enthusiasts. Learning about the unique experiences of others and sharing a passion for software development not only fuels my creativity, but also inspires me to become a better developer myself. I thrive in a fast-paced environment and enjoy taking on more responsibility as it keeps things exciting for me. My ultimate purpose, is to be a force for good in the world, and to pursue that through the creation of software.\n\n\n\nSince I began my software development journey, I've had a desire to read, write, and learn about everything software. Continuous improvement is something that's always been important to me because I know that there's so much I don't know and many mistakes I have yet to make; and I know that continuous improvement is the surest path to becoming the best version of myself.\n\n\n\nIn my full-time role, I am actively working with technologies such as Perl, Go, MySQL, Git, and Postman. I also enjoy working with technologies like NodeJS and React outside of work.\n\n\n\nIf you would like to connect or talk about anything software development, please feel free to reach out to me. I always welcome the opportunity to meet and talk to new people.",
